        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The great enemy of clear language is insincerity.\n—GEORGE ORWELL",
            "block_bbox": [
                228,
                370,
                622,
                419
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "global_block_id": 1,
            "global_group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    228.0,
                    370.0
                ],
                [
                    622.0,
                    370.0
                ],
                [
                    622.0,
                    419.0
                ],
                [
                    228.0,
                    419.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This book rests on two convictions: it is good to write clearly, and anyone can.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                446,
                738,
                469
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    446.0
                ],
                [
                    738.0,
                    446.0
                ],
                [
                    738.0,
                    469.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    469.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The first is self-evident, especially to anyone who has had to hack through a sentence like this:",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                472,
                772,
                521
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    80.0,
                    472.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    472.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    521.0
                ],
                [
                    80.0,
                    521.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An understanding of causal factors driving male underperformance on standardized verbal proficiency tests is prerequisite to the potential development of pedagogical strategies showing greater effectiveness.",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                535,
                742,
                610
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    535.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    535.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    610.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    610.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "All of us would much rather read something like this:",
            "block_bbox": [
                81,
                623,
                538,
                648
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    81.0,
                    623.0
                ],
                [
                    538.0,
                    623.0
                ],
                [
                    538.0,
                    648.0
                ],
                [
                    81.0,
                    648.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If we understood why male students underperform on standardized tests of verbal proficiency, we could perhaps develop better ways of teaching them.",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                661,
                741,
                711
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    110.0,
                    661.0
                ],
                [
                    741.0,
                    661.0
                ],
                [
                    741.0,
                    711.0
                ],
                [
                    110.0,
                    711.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The second, though, may seem unrealistic to those who count themselves lucky if they can just get down a thought in any words whatsoever, those who feel they have enough on their plates without worrying about how those words will seem to their readers. But to write clearly, we must consider our readers. Specifically, we must choose words and patterns of words that will help rather than hinder them in their efforts to understand our ideas.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                725,
                772,
                878
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    725.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    725.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    878.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    878.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This book shows you how.",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                881,
                346,
                904
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
